title: a test module binding the conftest guard's name to a platform check does not make it a gate
origin: #351 reading 1: the conftest's NO_NETWORK is an environment condition. Read in the test
origin2: module's names, its NO_NETWORK = sys.platform == "win32" would hold the new request at warn.
